    {"id":"p6-product-scenarios","note":"The bounded real resource queue, stale adoption, controlled transport and GC/cold-readback scenarios select their direct evaluator without starting the opt-in live run.","patterns":["scripts/g0-rs-p6-product-scenarios.mjs"],"tests":["test/g0-rs-p6-product-scenarios.test.mjs"],"classifiesScripts":false},
    {"id":"p6-canonical-source-binding","note":"Every source byte eligible for the canonical P6 binding selects the fast recomputing verifier. The bounded broad prefixes are intentional: a future source-map addition inside the same runtime surfaces must fail closed until evidence is refreshed, while the expensive live matrix remains opt-in.","patterns":["core/r-server/**","core/shared-backend/**","frontend/src/**","frontend/package.json","frontend/package-lock.json","package.json","package-lock.json","resources/built-in-plugins/deseq2/**","resources/built-in-plugins/gene-correlation/**","resources/built-in-plugins/go-kegg/**","resources/built-in-plugins/volcano-plot/**","scripts/g0-rs-p4r-capture.mjs","scripts/g0-rs-p5-acceptance.mjs","scripts/g0-rs-p6-*","src/backend-health.js","src/migration-runner.js","src/migrations/001_result_studio.sql","src/migrations/002_result_workflow_graph.sql","src/migrations/003_result_ref_transactions.sql","src/preload.js","test/**"],"tests":["test/g0-rs-p6-product-acceptance.test.mjs"],"classifiesScripts":false},
    {"id":"p6-product-durability-recovery-performance","note":"The canonical P6 producer and stored source-bound evidence select the direct recomputing verifier plus every component, durability, resource and private-artifact route regression. The default gate verifies stored observations; only the explicit update command runs the long real matrix.","patterns":["scripts/g0-rs-p6-product-acceptance.mjs","acceptance/g0-result-studio/rs-p6-durability-recovery-performance.json"],"tests":["test/g0-chf0-lifecycle.test.mjs","test/g0-rs-p6-product-acceptance.test.mjs","test/g0-rs-p6-real-restart-prototype.test.mjs","test/g0-rs-p6-electron-pressure-prototype.test.mjs","test/g0-rs-p6-recovery-electron-prototype.test.mjs","test/g0-rs-p6-product-scenarios.test.mjs","test/g0-rs-p6-recovery-acceptance.test.mjs","test/git-adapter.test.mjs","test/result-changeset-service.test.mjs","test/result-compare-service.test.mjs","test/result-ref-transaction.test.mjs","test/result-selection-tools.test.mjs","test/result-studio-lifecycle.test.mjs","test/result-studio-background.test.mjs","test/result-studio-migration.test.mjs","test/result-studio-repository.test.mjs","test/result-studio-resource-summary.test.mjs","test/result-studio-table-query.test.mjs","test/tool-resource-sampler.test.mjs","test/tools-executor-job-context.test.mjs","test/artifact-truth.test.mjs","test/result-studio-route-baseline.test.mjs","test/test-affected.test.mjs"],"classifiesScripts":false},
    {"id":"p7-honest-product-requalification","note":"The P7 source-bound producer is the only current Result Studio qualification owner. Default tests verify its independently resolvable fact-bundle contract and packaged CDP adapter; the explicit update gate alone builds and drives the real arm64 package with two configured Provider classes.","patterns":["scripts/g0-rs-p7-acceptance.mjs","scripts/g0-rs-p7-cdp.cjs","core/shared-backend/result-studio-qualification.js","core/shared-backend/result-studio-evidence-bundle.js","acceptance/g0-result-studio/rs-p7-honest-product-requalification.json","acceptance/g0-result-studio/rs-p7-evidence/**","acceptance/g0-result-studio/rs-p7-packaged-ui/**"],"tests":["test/g0-rs-p7-acceptance.test.mjs","test/g0-rs-p7-cdp.test.mjs","test/ai-settings-credential.test.mjs","test/result-studio-qualification.test.mjs","test/result-studio-evidence-bundle.test.mjs","test/result-studio-agent-binding.test.mjs","test/system-prompt-result-context.test.mjs"],"classifiesScripts":false},
